      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790931324850,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note: What from_host does",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note: What from_host does",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hwWVTja8rZTJG1sBhtWod",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 397.2249143125,
      "y": 887.4654510966818,
      "width": 669.5501708984375,
      "height": 108.19544135951311,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 946662678,
      "version": 779,
      "versionNonce": 621704970,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790931329728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The box in GPU memory is reserved right away (skips the queue).\n2. The only thing sent through the queue is the job: \"copy a_host into box A\".\n3. The copy engine moves data directly from CPU memory into box A (the data\nnever goes through the queue).\n4. Once the copy is done, the CPU is unblocked and the queue is empty again.",
      "fontSize": 17.311270617522098,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The box in GPU memory is reserved right away (skips the queue).\n2. The only thing sent through the queue is the job: \"copy a_host into box A\".\n3. The copy engine moves data directly from CPU memory into box A (the data\nnever goes through the queue).\n4. Once the copy is done, the CPU is unblocked and the queue is empty again.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wbymg_a7FUllCdo2f-UAd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 446.5499504746094,
      "y": 1024.0068183202432,
      "width": 603.0452270507812,
      "height": 108.19544135951311,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 920045386,
      "version": 1151,
      "versionNonce": 342009622,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790931390119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "`zeroed` is different: it also reserves a box right away\nand queues a job (\"fill with zeros\"), but it does NOT wait. The\nCPU moves straight on, and the job mat still be in the queue. That's\nfine: anything queued after it (like the kernel) only runs once the zeros\nare done.",
      "fontSize": 17.311270617522098,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "`zeroed` is different: it also reserves a box right away\nand queues a job (\"fill with zeros\"), but it does NOT wait. The\nCPU moves straight on, and the job mat still be in the queue. That's\nfine: anything queued after it (like the kernel) only runs once the zeros\nare done.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
